  "description": "The Rambo Quest is a full-suspension, step-thru electric bike built for riders who want capable off-road performance without the extra bulk. Powered by a Rambo 750W hub-drive motor delivering up to 1,000W of peak output and 60Nm of torque, the Quest tackles trails, hunting routes, and backcountry terrain with confidence.\nIts 52V battery and 5-level pedal assist system deliver a smooth, controlled ride, while the low step-thru frame makes mounting and dismounting effortless for riders of all sizes. Aggressive 20\" x 4.0 tires with 5mm anti-puncture protection grip loose and uneven ground, and the maintenance-free single-speed drivetrain keeps things simple and reliable.\nA waterproof LCD display with Adjustable Class System (ACS), integrated headlight and taillight, and a right-hand thumb throttle round out a bike built for comfort, control, and capability.\nCompact, full-suspension, and easy to handle, the Rambo Quest is available in Black and FDE and rated for riders and gear up to 300 lbs — ready for light-to-medium terrain, from hunting grounds to trail rides.",
